msgid "mount-observe interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/mount-observe-interface.md:4
msgid ""
"`mount-observe` enables a snap to read mount table and quota information. "
"This interface is restricted because it gives privileged read access to "
"mount arguments and should only be used with trusted apps."
msgstr ""

